messages[14]{user,text}:
  user_1,[00:00] Hi Neha, uh... I got your email about the renewal. Thanks.
  user_2,Hey Dev, good morning! Yeah I sent it over. Did you have a look at the numbers?
  user_1,Yeah, I saw the $1,250 premium with the 5% loyalty discount. Looks fine.
  user_2,Great. So you wanted the payment link, right?
  user_1,Exactly. And— uh— I also wanted to know, once I pay, does the policy start immediately? Or is there a gap?
  user_2,No gap. As soon as we get the payment, the coverage rolls over on the same day the old policy expires. [sighs] It's seamless.
  user_1,Good. And can I pay with a credit card? I don't have a checkbook handy.
  user_2,Absolutely, we accept Visa, MasterCard, Amex. I can send you a secure link right now.
  user_1,Perfect. Please send it.
  user_2,Sure thing— sending now. You'll get an email with the link, plus a short text if you prefer. Do you want the SMS too?
  user_1,Yeah, that'd be helpful. My number is the same as on file.
  user_2,All set. Once you click the link and complete payment, you'll get a confirmation receipt and the updated policy document. Anything else I can help with?
  user_1,No, that's all. Thanks, Neha.
  user_2,You're welcome! Have a great day, Dev.